    replacement_chunks {
      replacement_content: "# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\n## [Unreleased] - Sprint 10 and beyond\n\n## [1.0.0] - Sprint 1-9 Completions\n### Added\n- **Authentication**: Implemented NextAuth integration with custom login page and role-based access control (Employee vs. Team Leader).\n- **Database & Schema**: Configured Prisma with PostgreSQL/Neon, including core models for Users, Clients, Processes, Work Items, Stages, Notifications, and Tags.\n- **Team Leader Dashboard**:\n  - **Client Management**: Added Client details, contracts, quotas, and quota-based validations.\n  - **Process Builder**: Created templates, versions, and stages. Implemented stage builder for workflow definition.\n  - **Work Management**: Added Work Items list, detail view with stage progression.\n  - **Open Work Pool**: Added capabilities to view, assign, and manage unclaimed pool items.\n  - **Settings**: Configured capabilities, event types, tags, work types, and team management.\n- **Employee Dashboard**:\n  - **My Work**: View assigned work items and their stages.\n  - **Open Pool**: Browse and claim available stages based on employee capabilities.\n  - **Process Library**: View published process definitions and standards.\n  - **Client Directory**: Browse active clients.\n  - **Profile**: View personal information and assigned capabilities.\n- **Notifications**: Implemented notification bell, unread count badge, and notifications list view with mark-as-read functionality.\n- **UI Architecture**: Integrated shadcn/ui components, Next.js App Router layout, and global styling with Tailwind CSS.\n\n### Fixed\n- Stabilized Next.js App Router implementations and resolved basic layout constraints.\n"
